{"version": "research-digest-v8", "sourceHash": "7108fc279d19628b69a5666492cc1cdb5c536b257073167489eed6f7c8719977", "digest": {"title": "", "contentMarkdown": "## Prefix reuse\n\nA matching token prefix is reusable even when the question suffix changes. [E1]\n\n## Controlled comparison\n\nKeep the model, suffix length and timing fixed. Compare stable and shuffled prefixes and report latency distributions.\n\n## Limits\n\nA small example does not establish a universal speedup.", "citations": [{"id": 1, "claimType": "author-claim", "page": 1, "section": null, "evidenceId": null}], "assets": []}}